// phantom tool call. Field names mirror `function_call` so the
// web renderer can reuse the tool-card layout.
//
// **Parameters**
//
// - `agent` — Harness/agent name, e.g. `"claude-native-ui"`. Serialized as `"model"` for parity with other items.
